  "features": [],
  "description_text": "Protect your smartphone screen with the Premium Matte Frosted Privacy Tempered Glass Screen Protector – engineered for maximum durability, comfort, and privacy. Designed with advanced technology, this screen guard combines multiple features to give you a seamless user experience while keeping your device safe. • Matte Anti-Glare Finish: Say goodbye to irritating reflections and screen glare. The matte surface ensures clear and comfortable viewing even under bright sunlight or strong indoor lighting. • Frosted Privacy Protection: Keeps your sensitive information safe from prying eyes. Only you can see the screen clearly from the front, while side angles remain blurred for added privacy. • Scratch & Impact Resistance: Made with high-hardness tempered glass, it resists scratches, scuffs, and accidental drops – keeping your screen flawless and well-protected. • Anti-Static & Dust-Removal Technology: Easy, bubble-free installation with smart adsorption. Dust particles are automatically repelled during application, leaving your screen spotless. • High Definition Clarity: Despite its matte and privacy finish, the glass maintains excellent transparency and touch sensitivity, delivering a smooth, natural feel. • Smudge & Fingerprint Resistant: The oleophobic coating prevents oily fingerprints and smudges, keeping your screen clean and crystal clear. This upgraded screen protector is the perfect balance of style, durability, and functionality – ensuring your device looks sleek while staying fully protected.",
  "description_html": "<div>Protect your smartphone screen with the Premium Matte Frosted Privacy Tempered Glass Screen Protector – engineered for maximum durability, comfort, and privacy. Designed with advanced technology, this screen guard combines multiple features to give you a seamless user experience while keeping your device safe.</div>\n<div><span> • Matte Anti-Glare Finish: Say goodbye to irritating reflections and screen glare. The matte surface ensures clear and comfortable viewing even under bright sunlight or strong indoor lighting.</span></div>\n<div><span> • Frosted Privacy Protection: Keeps your sensitive information safe from prying eyes. Only you can see the screen clearly from the front, while side angles remain blurred for added privacy.</span></div>\n<div><span> • Scratch &amp; Impact Resistance: Made with high-hardness tempered glass, it resists scratches, scuffs, and accidental drops – keeping your screen flawless and well-protected.</span></div>\n<div><span> • Anti-Static &amp; Dust-Removal Technology: Easy, bubble-free installation with smart adsorption. Dust particles are automatically repelled during application, leaving your screen spotless.</span></div>\n<div><span> • High Definition Clarity: Despite its matte and privacy finish, the glass maintains excellent transparency and touch sensitivity, delivering a smooth, natural feel.</span></div>\n<div><span> • Smudge &amp; Fingerprint Resistant: The oleophobic coating prevents oily fingerprints and smudges, keeping your screen clean and crystal clear.</span></div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>This upgraded screen protector is the perfect balance of style, durability, and functionality – ensuring your device looks sleek while staying fully protected.</div>"
}